        <mxCell id="intra_node" value="CMF talks to: SQL Server (out via egress) + Kafka (CFK or VM, out via egress) + Flink Operator (in-cluster)&#10;JobManager talks to: TaskManagers (in-cluster pod-network) + CMF (in-cluster, status updates)&#10;TaskManagers talk to: each other (data-exchange, in-cluster) + Kafka brokers (out via egress) + Schema Registry (out via egress) + NetApp S3 (out via egress, checkpoints)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
